    "q-182694": {
      "dom_id": "step-q182694",
      "name": "Question 7",
      "problem": "Find the missing values in the following truth table:\n\n| $\\,X\\,$ | $\\,Y\\,$ | $\\,(X∨Y)⇒(X∧Y)\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | {{field-1}} |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | {{field-2}} |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | {{field-3}} |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | {{field-4}} |",
      "worked_solution": "First, we add columns for $X∨Y$ and $X∧Y:$\n\n| $\\,X\\,$ | $\\,Y\\,$ | $\\,X∨Y\\,$ | $\\,X∧Y\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n\nNow, we add a column for $(X∨Y)⇒(X∧Y).$ This statement is true unless $X∨Y$ is true and $X∧Y$ is false.\n\n| $\\,X\\,$ | $\\,Y\\,$ | $\\,X∨Y\\,$ | $\\,X∧Y\\,$ | $\\,(X∨Y)⇒(X∧Y)\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
